OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be quite breezy and
OL,6,Ffeeling fresher with some showers.
OL,7,FGenerally a rather cloudy day but a
OL,8,Ffew bright or sunny intervals possible
OL,9,Fat times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBright or clear spells and a
OL,12,Ffew showers through the evening.
OL,13,FShowers become mostly confined to
OL,14,Fcounties Derry and Tyrone overnight,
OL,15,Fbecoming dry with clear spells
OL,16,Felsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
