OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FDry with sunny spells for most
OL,6,Fto start but cloudy with scattered
OL,7,Fshowers in the northwest. Bright
OL,8,Fspells and showers for all through the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FRemaining quite cool with variable
OL,13,Fcloud and sunny spells over the
OL,14,Fweekend, mainly dry though with some
OL,15,Flight showers. Dry and milder on
OL,16,FMonday with bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
